From e0d44f0f1aa523e51aff1c794b76ca5d6ed368e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 27 Aug 2024 12:15:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-7268] scripts: add palad conversion scripts

Add 2 useful image conversion scripts for palladium:
1. convert_app_to_ccm_hex.sh - gets a path to an app binary and
   produces hex files that can be loaded directly to CCM memories.
2. convert_app_to_io_bootrom_hex.sh - gets a path to an app binary and
   produces hex file that can be loaded directly to IO die bootrom
   memory.

Additional tools are added to allow those scripts to do their thing.

Change-Id: Ib81c72fe50ddec2687f544b572a2acdad03518ab
Signed-off-by: Igal Zeltser <izeltser@habana.ai>
---

